  "body": "Secure and non-secure contexts are exported from both the HTML spec and the Secure Contexts spec... when referencing these terms, which spec should an editor cite? I wonder if we should only have a single source of truth (Secure Contexts?).\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#secure-context\r\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/secure-contexts/#secure-context\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#non-secure-context\r\nhttps://www.w3.org/TR/secure-contexts/#non-secure-context\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
